DESCRIPTION:Join us for Pride & Community\, a group exhibition in the Caus
 eway Gallery exploring what pride and community mean through the eyes of l
 ocal LGBTQ\\+ artists and allies. The featured artists were invited to res
 pond to the prompt: “Pride & Community — what does this theme mean to
  you?” The works submitted range from 2D and 3D pieces to augmented r
 eality\, each offering a personal\, moving\, and pride-filled reflection o
 n life within Sonoma Valley and the LGBTQ\\+ community. Sonoma Community C
 enter is proud to partner with Sonoma Valley Pride to create a welcoming s
 pace for these artists to share their work\, connect with the broader comm
 unity\, and offer their pieces for sale. Featuring wines by Pangloss Cella
 rs and bites from Aunt Momo’s.\n\nFeatured Artists:\n\nKatherine Allbrig
 ht\n\nDaniel Clauson\n\nSpencer DeSylva\n\nScott Hale\n\nAsh Hay\n\nJon Le
 afstedt\n\nJules Pierce\n\nDylan Smith\n\nExhibition Details\n\nLOCATION C
 auseway Gallery\, Sonoma Community Center\n\nON VIEW June 4 – 30\, 2026\
 n\nOpening Reception Thursday\, June 4 from 5 – 7:30 PM\n\nARTISTS 8 EXH
 IBITION ARTISTS\n\nADMISSIONFree & Open to the Public
LOCATION:Sonoma Community Center
