BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Johnny Vernazza
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260604T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260604T203000
UID:260527QJnDHADcjUuMVnMKD7lPrw
DESCRIPTION:A multiple gold recording artist brings real blues-rock histor
 y to the Marquee Club\n\nA true Bay Area blues-rock legend is coming to th
 e Empress Marquee Club.\n\nJohnny “V” Vernazza is not just another gui
 tarist — he is part of the real history of American blues and rock.\n\nB
 orn in San Francisco and raised in Daly City\, Johnny came up during the e
 xplosive Bay Area music scene of the 1960s\, when the Fillmore\, Avalon Ba
 llroom\, North Beach clubs\, and Golden Gate Park concerts were helping sh
 ape a whole generation of music.\n\nJohnny went on to share stages and stu
 dios with some of the greats\, including Luther Tucker\, Sunnyland Slim\, 
 Chuck Berry\, Steve Miller\, Gregg Allman\, George Thorogood\, Charlie Dan
 iels\, Commander Cody\, Norton Buffalo\, and Elvin Bishop.\n\nDoor opens f
 or dinner 5:30 p.m. Music 6:30 p.m.
LOCATION:Empress Marquee Club
URL:https://empresstheatre.org/event/johnny-vernazza/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
