BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Social Contractors Kick off "Live Music Thursdays" @ Taps!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260604T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260604T210000
UID:260526-dgK05Da0EyDmUkQXbIAkg
DESCRIPTION:“….Get ready for the super-entertaining sounds of local ba
 nd The Social Contractors. They totally rock\, in all the right ways…”
  - Argus-Courier\n\nJoin us as we kick off "Live Music Thursdays" at Taps 
 on the River in historic downtown Petaluma!\n\nWe'll be performing our upb
 eat blend of original alternative\, progressive\, rock\, with our own spin
  on classic hits you know and love from the 60s-90s \\(e.g. Beatles\, CCR\
 , Doors\, Police\, Men At Work\, Hendrix\, Pink Floyd\, Tears for Fears\, 
 Steely Dan\, U2\, and more\\).\n\nWith searing sax and guitar solos\, melo
 dic vocals\, and thought provoking lyrics\, the original cuts will get you
  tapping and thinking as you enjoy fine craft brews and an array of delici
 ous fare from the Taps menu. \n\nThe Social Contractors lineup for this e
 vent includes band founder\, Jason E. Davies \\(vocals\, lead/rhythm guita
 r\\)\, Travis Thayer \\(sax/keys/vocals\\)\, Rob Neidel \\(bass/vocals\\)\
 , and guest artist Robert Ramirez \\(drums\\).\n\nAn intimate northern CA 
 pub vibe plus amazing views overlooking the Petaluma river makes this a un
 iquely enjoyable venue.
LOCATION:Taps on The River
URL:https://tapsontheriver.com
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
