 om chemical engineering to coaching to help others find their "strong pers
 onal foundation." This session provides a serene space to explore emotiona
 l resilience and mindfulness\, encouraging a deeper connection with yourse
 lf through the lens of Mayra’s empowering\, global perspective.\n\nAdmis
 sion: $45 per person\; waived with a purchase of 2 or more bottles.
