UID:260604y8JbSUn7v0yNF3SRUSlQeg
DESCRIPTION:Winner of the Tony "Triple Crown" for Best Musical\, Best Scor
 e and Best Book\, Avenue Q is part flesh\, part felt and packed with heart
 . Book by Jeff Whitty Music and lyrics by Robert Lopez and Jeff Marx Direc
 tor and Choreographer: Serena Elize Flores The laugh-out-loud musical tell
 s the timeless story of a recent college grad named Princeton\, who moves 
 into a shabby New York apartment all the way out on Avenue Q. He soon disc
 overs that\, although the residents seem nice\, it's clear that this is no
 t your ordinary neighborhood. Together\, Princeton and his new-found frien
 ds struggle to find jobs\, dates and their ever-elusive purpose in life. D
 oors open 6:30 pm. TICKETS ZONE A \\(Close to the action\\) $45 ZONE B \\(
 Middle of the house\\) $35 ZONE C \\(In the back\\) $25 Tickets at Door - 
 $45 - So buy in advance! SPECIAL DATES Friday 5/22: OPENING NIGHT & PARTY 
 - Stick around to celebrate after the show! Wed 5/27: INDUSTRY NITE - Call
 ing all theatre people! All tickets $20. Thur 5/28: THRIFTY THURSDAY - $10
  off all tickets
LOCATION:528 7th St
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/2215993245872019/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
