UID:260420BuuVJby960-fqmY3LEcV1w
DESCRIPTION:Unlock your inner strength and find your flow. Belly dancing 
 with Raja is an innovative fusion class that blends the rhythmic artistry 
 of belly dance with the high-energy benefits of aerobics. Designed to b
 e both a cardiovascular challenge and a deep toning session\, this class f
 ocuses on the “powerhouse” of the body—your core.\n\nBy layering flu
 id\, isolative movements over an athletic aerobic base\, you will challeng
 e your muscles in ways traditional gym workouts can’t reach.\n\nWhat to 
 Expect\n\n• Core-Centric Power: Use undulations and shimmies to engage 
 deep abdominal muscles for a tighter\, stronger midsection.\n\n• Functio
 nal Stability: Improve your balance and posture through controlled\, hip-
 driven movements and low-impact aerobic footwork.\n\n• Total Body Toning
 : Build lean muscle in your legs\, glutes\, and arms while maintaining a 
 constant\, heart-pumping pace.\n\n• Mind-Body Connection: Enhance your 
 coordination and body awareness through rhythmic\, expressive choreography
 .\n\n“Whether you’re looking to define your waistline or simply want a
  workout that feels like a celebration\, this class offers the perfect bal
 ance of sweat and grace.”\n\nDifficulty Level: All levels welcome! No p
 rior dance experience is required—just bring your energy and a willingne
 ss to move.\n\nDATE AND TIME: Thursdays at 5:30 PM
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/belly-dancing-with-raja
 /18622402/2026-06-04T17
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
