  Reyes National Seashore!\n\nJoin us on Friday\, June 5th from 4pm-7pm
  for our fifth annual Pride in Our Park event\, hosted by Point Reyes Na
 tional Seashore Association. This is an opportunity to celebrate queerness
  in the human and natural worlds\, connect with the land\, and build commu
 nity. We will start at Bear Valley Trailhead and make our way to Divide 
 Meadow before heading back to the Bear Valley Grove \\(~3 flat miles round
 trip\\) for food\, live music by Good Friends\, and an art-making activity
  for all ages led by Favianna Rodriguez. All are welcome!
