BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Cline Cellars
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260605T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260605T000000
UID:260327JpEoCCOLMk-SdkpLJ-Ym3A
DESCRIPTION:Join Michelle at Cline Cellars for their Friday Jams Music Ser
 ies. Enjoy the beautiful outdoor venue in Sonoma while taking in Michelle'
 s acoustic show. More info available here: https://clinecellars.com/\n\nBa
 y Area breakout artist Michelle Lambert delivers a fun\, high-energy show 
 filled with edgy\, heartfelt original music\, infectious pop hooks\, and u
 nstoppable charisma. Fresh off a successful 40-date tour across the Wester
 n states last year\, Michelle captivates audiences with soaring vocals\, d
 ynamic violin solos\, and vibrant energy that radiates through the crowd. 
 Her electrifying performances create an unforgettable live experience that
  will have you dancing\, smiling\, and celebrating all night long.\n\nRais
 ed in Northern California and trained at the prestigious Berklee College o
 f Music\, Michelle Lambert has forged her own path as a fearless\, indepen
 dent pop artist. She has topped the charts of Indie Radio with her origina
 l songs and was featured in the San Francisco Giants’ City Connect Campa
 ign as a notable Bay Area artist. Michelle cut her teeth performing and wr
 iting in the competitive music scenes of Nashville and Los Angeles before 
 returning to the Bay Area to tour with her own thriving career. Known for 
 her powerful vocals\, masterful violin playing\, and bold\, colorful costu
 mes\, Michelle pairs striking visuals with raw emotional storytelling—em
 bodying creativity\, resilience\, and the adventure of chasing your dreams
 . For more info on Michelle visit: https://www.michellelambert.com
LOCATION:Cline Family Cellars
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/108106538?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
