BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Ariel Marin Boogie Nights
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260605T203000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260605T223000
UID:260603cUMAzrFRVE-AwOTPIKH4Ag
DESCRIPTION:Friday night belongs on the dance floor. Join us at the Empres
 s Marquee Club for Boogie Nights\, a high-energy evening of live music\, d
 inner\, cocktails\, and dancing featuring the powerhouse vocals of Ariel M
 arin\, multi-platinum producer and music director James “Jae-E” Earley
 \, and very special guest Terrie Odabi.\n\nAriel Marin brings a big\, soul
 ful voice and the kind of stage presence that turns a show into a party. H
 er sound blends soul\, R&B\, funk\, dance music\, and classic feel-good fa
 vorites into a night made for moving.\n\nBehind the groove is James “Jae
 -E” Earley\, a multi-platinum producer\, bassist\, music director\, engi
 neer\, and songwriter whose deep pocket and musical leadership give the ni
 ght its drive. Together\, Ariel and Jae-E bring a polished\, energetic sho
 w built for the Marquee Club dance floor.\n\nDoors open for dinner at 6 p.
 m. Music: 8:30 to10:30 p.m. Dancing encouraged - let the music move you!
LOCATION:Empress Marquee Club
URL:https://empresstheatre.org/event/ariel-boogie-nights/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Lavender Bloom Fest\, Sunset Evenings - Bees N Blooms
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260605T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260605T210000
UID:260603QdcesdtYt0q8BnqeCG0rAQ
DESCRIPTION:Bees N Blooms invites you to one of our five Friday Sunset Eve
 nings from 6PM to 9 PM during our annual Lavender Bloom Fest.  There’s n
 othing quite like experiencing lavender at sunset\, when the Labyrinth glo
 ws with soft evening light. Tacos Don Pepe’s food truck will be on site\
 , serving up organic\, locally sourced Mexican food with vegan options OR 
 bring your own dinner to savor in the Pavilion as the sun sets over the fa
 rm. Join us on May 29 and every Friday in June from 6PM to 9PM. \n\nWe are
  also open Saturdays and Sundays from 10 AM to 4 PM through July 12th. Com
 e see the lavender in bloom and enjoy a lovely day surrounded by nature! A
 dmission is $15 per person on most days and $20 per person on the days wit
 h the jazz band \\(Sundays May 24\, June 21 and July 12th 10 am to 4 pm\, 
 Jazz noon to 3 pm\\). Kids 12 and under are free with an adult. Visit our 
 website\, beesnblooms.com\, for more details and visit our online store\, 
 found at beesnblooms.com/shop\, to purchase tickets.  The Nursery and Farm
  Stand will also be open on Saturdays and Sundays during Lavender Bloom Fe
 st. See you on the farm!
LOCATION:The California
URL:https://www.farmtrails.org/event/lavender-daze-19/2026-06-05/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
