DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260606T133000
UID:260528k7AdzrDBJUuplALNnzFhCQ
DESCRIPTION:**ABOUT THE RAMBLE**\n\n**An intimate music\, food & wine fest
 ival with purpose.** Small by design. Exceptional by nature.\n\nThe Ramble
  is a boutique music and wine festival in the heart of Sonoma County—cur
 ated for connection\, discovery\, and impact\, while shining a light on th
 e beauty of wine country lifestyle.\n\nCreated by Noah & Kelly Dorrance of
  BloodRoot and Reeve Wines—music lovers & community ambassadors—The Ra
 mble brings together acclaimed artists\, local food and wine\, and a deepl
 y engaged audience for a weekend that feels rare\, intentional\, and perso
 nal. From the beginning\, The Ramble has been committed to giving back. 10
 0% of proceeds are donated. Impact is not an add-on\, it’s the foundatio
 n.\n\n**2023** featured The Lone Bellow\, SUSTO\, Cayucas\, Spike Sikes & 
 His Awesome Hotcakes\n\n**2024** featured Lord Huron\, Andrew Bird\, Cauti
 ous Clay\, and The Nude Party\n\n**2025** featured Ziggy Marley\, Local Na
 tives\, Richy Mitch & The Coal Miners\, La Luz\, and The Coffis Brothers\n
 \n**VENDORS**\n\n*APPLICATIONS ARE NOW OPEN*\n\nCalling all vendors! The R
 amble is looking for local vendors to participate in our many events.\n\n*
 *VOLUNTEERS**\n\n*APPLICATIONS ARE NOW OPEN*\n\nJoin our festival voluntee
 r team! Learn the ropes and hang with like-minded music folks. Dates are J
 une 5 - 6!\n\n**THE CAUSE**\n\nAll proceeds from the entire weekend will g
 o to helping fight gun violence\, through our partnership with GIFFORDS\, 
 in honor of our niece\, Evelyn who we lost in the Nashville Covenant Schoo
 l shooting. GIFFORDS is an organization dedicated to saving lives from gun
  violence. Together we inspire the courage of people from all walks of lif
 e to make America safer.
LOCATION:Abel de la Luna Community Center Fields
URL:https://www.bloodrootramble.com/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
