UID:260527iXxAzDDYHUCGjzxrDUFCag
DESCRIPTION:This summer\, The Lodge at Dawn Ranch is elevating the wine di
 nner beyond pairings and pours with the launch of Collector's Cellar\, an 
 ongoing series offering guests access to rare bottles\, acclaimed producer
 s\, historic wineries\, and collaborations typically reserved for collecto
 rs and wine industry insiders. \n\nOn June 6 from 5-8 pm\, guests can exp
 erience a first-ever restaurant collaboration with Sordo\, one of Barolo
 ’s oldest and most respected producers. Justin Grover of Fine Wines Inte
 rnational\, whose collection of rare and historic bottles is considered am
 ong the world’s most significant\, will lead guests through six courses 
 and six tastings. The series is designed to deepen guests’ connection to
  the stories\, philosophies\, and craftsmanship behind the glass\, bringin
 g together pioneering winemakers and singular wines that reflect a distinc
 t sense of place and identity.
LOCATION:The Lodge at Dawn Ranch
