UID:260526X917IMVPA06etilEEZ-Quw
DESCRIPTION:Come explore the hills between Fairfield\, Benicia\, and Valle
 jo. Solano Land Trust docents will guide you through this area\, known as 
 the King-Swett Ranches. Docents will share insights about the birds and ot
 her wildlife that call this area home\, and give you a great workout!\n\nH
 ike level: Moderate to Moderately Strenuous Please note: Vallejo Swett is 
 an undeveloped property with no formal trails. This is a rugged & an off t
 rail hike. Participants could be climbing or going under fences\, and tree
  branches. Docents also can go up & along of steep and clumpy ground mount
 ain sides.\n\n\\*Please note\, cancellation of the hike may occur due to C
 ounty Fire Danger Warnings and closures of open spaces and parks. Once reg
 istered\, you will receive any updates should this ever happen.
LOCATION:King-Swett Ranches
URL:https://solanolandtrust.org/events-news/event-calendar.html/event/2026
 /06/06/nature-hike-at-vallejo-swett-ranches-june/565216
