 pañarnos ese día? ¡Guarda la fecha el 11 de julio para más aventuras!\
 n\nSenderos Naturales es parcialmente respaldado por una beca de Parks Cal
 ifornia.\n\n\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\n\nENGLISH: C
 ome learn more about our universe! Docents from the Robert Ferguson Observ
 atory (located within Sugarloaf Ridge State Park) will guide us on an astr
 onomy presentation in Spanish and viewing of the spring sky through telesc
 opes.\n\nAdmission is $10 for adults\, $5 for youth under 18.\n\nThis even
 t is planned around a primarily Latino audience and will be conducted in S
 panish. Families from underrepresented groups are welcome to join. For que
 stions\, please email senderos@sonomaecologycenter.org.
LOCATION:Sugarloaf Ridge State Park
URL:https://www.simpletix.com/e/senderos-rfo-observacion-de-estrellas-2026
 -tickets-241546
