BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Makers Market™ America's 250th Birthday Event @ First Street Nap
 a
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260606T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260606T170000
UID:260531RX2wfleqlUa43nAl5ROmDw
DESCRIPTION:Makers Market™ is hosting a free event to celebrate America'
 s birthday\, American craftsmanship and community\, and a decade of Makers
  Market™ supporting makers across the USA!\n\nFor over a decade\, Makers
  Market™ has been been honored to work alongside makers\, artists\, and 
 small businesses across the USA to share their stories and connect custome
 rs with thoughtfully made products. As America approaches its 250th Birthd
 ay\, we are marking this milestone with celebrations that honor not only o
 ur nation's history\, but also the creativity\, entrepreneurial spirit\, c
 raftsmanship\, and sense of community that continue to define America toda
 y. These birthday celebrations are about bringing people together and cele
 brating the unique spirit of our local communities.\n\nWHEN? Saturday\, Ju
 ne 6 | 11am - 5pm\n\nWHERE? First Street Napa in Napa\, CA\n\n- Custom iro
 n-on patch bar featuring Americana-inspired designs for denim jackets\, ca
 nvas totes\, and baseball caps\n\n- DIY red\, white & blue candle-making s
 tation\n\n- Live music from local musicians\n\n- Free birthday treats\n\n-
  Free July 4th-inspired cocktail tastings\n\n- Giveaway for the first 25 c
 ustomers at Makers Market™ First Street Napa\n\n- All-day raffles\n\n- T
 his celebration will coincide with Makers Market™ Local Artist Fairs\, h
 osting vibrant community gatherings filled with local art\, handmade goods
 \, live entertainment\, and small-business shopping.\n\n- Stop into the Ma
 kers Market™ brick-and-mortar store \\(in Suite 301\, adjacent to the fa
 ir\\) and shop even more unique\, American-made products.\n\nShare with yo
 ur shopping buddies and mark your calendars! Can't wait to see you there!\
 n\n- - -\n\nAre you a maker looking to sell your products at the Local Art
 ist Street Fair? Register here:\n\nhttps://makersmarket.us/maker-registrat
 ion/\n\n- - -\n\nMakers Market is locally founded and independently owned\
 , with brick-and-mortar stores in Alpharetta\, Napa\, Santana Row\, Lafaye
 tte\, and Mill Valley. We aim to bring you products that honor the ideals 
 of American craftsmanship and are modern\, handmade\, and sustainably prod
 uced. Join us in our mission of Rebuilding the Legacy of American Made\, w
 hile supporting our local artists\, local economies\, and the community. C
 ome visit one of our stores today!\n\nhttps://makersmarket.us/locations/
LOCATION:First Street Napa
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/4156976651222073/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
