BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sunday Swing Night at Hall of the Above
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260607T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260607T190000
UID:260504u6owEAqQfUOEIhFoq0SAsg
DESCRIPTION:Join us on the first Sunday of every month for SUNDAY SWING NI
 GHT at Hall of the Above\n\n🎷 Featuring a new-to-HOTA band\, The doRiaN
  Mode! 🎷\n\nThe doRiaN Mode explores the Great American Songbook as it 
 dishes up vintage jazz\, swinging R&B\, and soulful ballads\, from the sou
 nds of 1920s speakeasies and 1930s big-band swing to 1940s jump blues and 
 the rollicking R&B of Ruth Brown. Vocalist and bassist Dorian Bartley lea
 ds this Petaluma-based acoustic quartet featuring Robby Elfman on piano/cl
 arinet\, Peter Graves on sax\, and Tony Blake on drums. Whether they’re
  stomping at the Savoy in salute to Count Basie or paying homage to R&B le
 gend Etta James\, the doRiaN Mode brings elegance to classic American musi
 c.\n\n💃🏻 Jasmine Worrell\, the Bay Area’s top swing dance instruct
 or\, will offer a class from 4:15 – 5:00\n\n👯 Followed by live music 
 and an open dance floor until 7:00 PM\n\n🎟️ $25 for admission include
 s the class — cash at the door. Kids 12 and under are free.\n\n🕺🏾 
 All skill levels welcome\; no partner required.\n\nSee you on the dance fl
 oor!
LOCATION:Hall of the Above
URL:https://www.halloftheabove.com/event-database/swing-dancing-at-hall-of
 -the-above-87jr4-tf756-m2l57-33xey-n2f47
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:COUNTRY CHORALE
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260607T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260607T170000
UID:260430JjnqQdg7-UiK2OY4BMpBpA
DESCRIPTION:**Sing Napa Valley Presents: COUNTRY CHORALE -** A Choral Cele
 bration of Country Music\n\nGet ready for rich harmonies\, heartfelt story
 telling\, and “toes-tappin’” fun! **Sing Napa Valley** community cho
 ir invites you to *Country Chorale*\, a lively and contemporary choral con
 cert celebrating the uniquely American tradition of country music.\n\nFrom
  **Dolly Parton** and **John Denver** to **Brandi Carlile**\, **Gram Parso
 ns**\, and **The Chicks**\, this program features beloved country classics
  reimagined through glorious choral harmony—performed by women’s\, men
 ’s\, and mixed ensembles\, plus our full choir. Whether you’re a lifel
 ong country fan or just love great choral music\, *Country Chorale* offers
  something for everyone. Come enjoy a fresh\, sophisticated take on a genr
 e full of heart\, soul\, and harmony!\n\n📅 Sunday\, June 7\, 2026 🕒 
 3:00 p.m.\n\n📍 First Presbyterian Church Gymnasium\,\n\n1333 Third Stre
 et\, downtown Napa (across from the Uptown Theatre)\n\n🎟 **Tickets:** $
 25 General Admission $10 Students\n\n👉 Grab your tickets and join us fo
 r an afternoon of unforgettable music!
LOCATION:First Presbyterian Church
URL:http://www.singnapavalley.org
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
