DESCRIPTION:Tickets are now on sale for Big West Wine Fest\, the largest g
 athering of California natural winemakers. The event takes place in the ic
 onic redwood grove at Solar Punk Farms just steps from downtown Guernevill
 e and the Russian River. \n\n“When Nina & I met we were working for lea
 ders in Sonoma County’s natural wine scene. We were inspired to celebrat
 e our local community outside of the typical wine festival structure. Our 
 intention is to capture an expansive sample of this moment in Northern Cal
 ifornia wine culture in a way that truly reflects this place. You can expe
 ct to taste wines from producers pouring their 40th vintage to producers r
 eleasing their first bottlings.” (Emily Weber\, Co-Founder). Check out t
 he full line up of over 75 producers from Sonoma County & further afield o
 nline at www.bigwestwinefest.com**.**
LOCATION:Solar Punk Farms
URL:http://bigwest.biz
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
