 mpers will solve mysteries together with block towers to set the scene. Le
 ap from one mat to another\, hide behind blocks\, tuck and roll over equip
 ment and become the best Secret Agent ever! Campers will craft their own s
 ecret agent badges with their photos\, and get to play with new friends or
