DESCRIPTION:Schedule\n\nEvery Monday · 8 Weeks\n\nDate & Time\n\nJune 8 
 – July 27\, 2026\n\n2:00 PM – 5:00 PM\n\nLocation\n\nRoom 117\, Cerami
 cs Studio\n\nCategory\n\nCeramics\, Extended Classes\n\nExperience Level\n
 \nAll Levels\n\nAges\n\n17\\+\n\nRegistration Cost:\n\n$265\n\nMaterials F
 ee:\n\n$30\n\nTotal Registration Cost:\n\n$295\n\nprogram overview\n\nDeve
 lop and improve your throwing skills while exploring a range of forms thro
 ugh multiple class projects in this all-level throwing class.  The instru
 ctor guides you through the basic steps of throwing\, shaping\, and trimmi
 ng of pottery on the wheel.  This class is a great opportunity for studet
 o hone basic techniques of throwing on the wheel and expand skills in all 
 aspects of pottery.  Surface decoration techniques will be explored.
