DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260610T173000
UID:260602EYP-bv8kZUm3n6Sj9gn5Ag
DESCRIPTION:Happy Pride! June’s LGBTQ Book Club selection is the beloved
  award-winning “Aristotle and Dante Discover the Secrets of the Universe
 ” by Benjamin Sáenz on Wednesday\, June 10th at 5:30pm. Aristotle is an
  angry teen with a brother in prison. Dante is a know-it-all who has an un
 usual way of looking at the world. When the two meet at the swimming pool\
 , they seem to have nothing in common. But as the loners start spending ti
 me together\, they discover that they share a special friendship—the kin
 d that changes lives and lasts a lifetime. And it is through this friendsh
 ip that Ari and Dante will learn the most important truths about themselve
 s and the kind of people they want to be. Books are available in the shop\
 , online and ebook bookshop.org/alibibookshop and audio: Libro.fm/alibiboo
 kshop
