DESCRIPTION:Unwind midweek at Wax & Relax\, a laid-back evening of vinyl-o
 nly sounds curated by DJ Noah Deezlee. Immerse yourself in the warm\, anal
 og vibes as classic grooves and deep cuts fill the Mercy Lounge.\n\nWhethe
 r you're a vinyl enthusiast or just looking for a chill night out\, this i
 s the perfect space to relax\, connect\, and enjoy great music.Proudly spo
 nsored by Turn\, this free event takes place every second Wednesday of the
