 oughtfully paired wines from Priest Ranch and Somerston Estate will be sel
 ected to enhance each dish\n\nA culinary takeaway showcasing their culinar
 y influences\n\nAnd access to exclusive pricing and limited-release bottle
 s of the night’s featured wines\n\nJoin us for this exclusive dining exp
 erience\, blending global cuisines with the artistry of Napa Valley wine.
  Seating is extremely limited\, so secure your place at the table for this
  exciting evening!
