DESCRIPTION:Whimsical Animals in Acrylic!\n\n100% beginner-friendly\n\nIn 
 these fun & expressive acrylic painting sessions\, each week we'll paint a
 nimals. These guys will have charm\, charisma\, & character to spare!\n\nT
 he goal is to let loose\, enjoy the process of painting & expressing yours
 elf.\n\nWhat you'll learn:\n\n💜 How to transfer or sketch a reference p
 icture onto your canvas.\n\n💜 How to mix\, blend\, and build layers wit
 h acrylic paint.\n\n💜 Most importantly\, practice letting go! Learning 
 how to play\, explore\, and have fun making art!\n\nJune 04 - Elephants\n\
 nJune 11 - Dogs\n\nJune 18 - Sheep\n\nJune 25 - Tigers\n\nThursdays\, 1-3 
 PM\, $45 per class.\n\nBring a friend & both get $10 off!
