DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260611T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260611T221500
UID:260514jdSPY091PEiw7OQ3FUnDUA
DESCRIPTION:. ***Whose Rhyme?*** is an original\, high-energy hip hop game
 show where a rotating cast of skilled MCs use their abilities on the Mic t
 o navigate a series of fast-paced\, improvisational rap games driven by au
 dience participation and live music. Games include *Rap Relay*\, *What Had
  Happened Was…*\, *Bars From The Crowd*\, *No Rhyme*\, and many more. Ea
 ch episode is a one-of-a-kind experience. Hosted by the improvisational hi
 p hop duo **Dark Matter Lives!** The debut episode takes place at **The Lo
 st Church on Thursday\, June 11\, 2026**\, featuring our first round of co
 ntestants: **Kayatta (@kayattamusic)\, Mr. BMMNM!!! (@illlbmmnminati)\, Th
 e Maine Man (@rapsmaineman)\,** and host **King Lung (@kinglungttm).** Liv
 e beat production will be provided by **Dark Matter Lives!**\, bringing a 
 flexible\, responsive musical backbone to each game and performance.
LOCATION:The Lost Church Santa Rosa
URL:https://www.darkmatterlives.com/whose-rhyme-rap-gameshow.html
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
