BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Cotati Free Summer Movie in the Park - June 2026 - GOAT
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260612T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260612T220000
UID:2606032T9pZjafgkm29mkPmuoD6Q
DESCRIPTION:Come join us for a FREE movie in La Plaza Park three times thi
 s summer!\n\nBring blankets or chairs and a picnic dinner or snacks! Don't
  forget to bring layers as it does get chilly when the sun goes down.\n\nJ
 une's movie will be GOAT!\n\nSynopsis A small goat with big dreams gets a 
 once-in-a-lifetime shot to join the pros and play roarball\, a high-intens
 ity\, co-ed\, full-contact sport dominated by the fastest\, fiercest anima
 ls in the world.\n\nThe June movie will begin at approximately 8:30pm.\n\n
