DESCRIPTION:Founded by Remi Moulder\, The Old Souls: Blues Experiment is a
  high-voltage preservation of electric blues built on a foundation of deep
  audience connection and charismatic showmanship. This diverse collective 
 of young musicians is dedicated to keeping the fire of electric blues-rock
  alive\, blending the raw energy of modern youth with the timeless grit of
  the masters.\n\nOur mission is simple: to prove that the blues isn't a mu
 seum piece—it’s a living\, breathing\, and electric force. We’ve spe
 nt our lives chasing the sounds of legends like B.B. King\, Eric Clapton\,
  Stevie Ray Vaughan\, and Joe Bonamassa\, reimagining that legacy for a ne
 w generation.
