DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260613T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260613T213000
UID:2605276XIpA0ac0UuESZE8DUVHSQ
DESCRIPTION:Welcome the spring season with a night under the stars on the 
 Miller House Lawn as we screen the beloved romantic comedy Pretty Woman—
 a film that holds special meaning for our Founder\, Rich Frank from his ti
 me at Disney Studios. Settle in vineyard-side and enjoy an evening of grea
 t wine\, cozy seating\, and classic cinema as Julia Roberts and Richard Ge
 re light up the screen.\n\nWine & Treats:\n\nEnjoy pours of your favorite 
 Frank Family wines all evening long\, alongside movie theater–style popc
 orn and an elevated candy bar.\n\nSpecial Moment:\n\nHear from Rich Frank 
 himself as he shares why this film is so meaningful to him and his career 
 in the entertainment business.\n\nShow Time:\n\nGuest arrival begins at 6:
 30 pm and the movie starts at sundown.\n\nSeating:\n\nRelax in Adirondack 
 chairs or plush couch seating on the Miller House Lawn - no need to bring 
 your own.\n\nWeather:\n\nGuests are encouraged to dress for a cool spring 
 evening in Napa Valley. We recommend bringing a light layer or blanket to 
 stay comfortable as the sun sets. In the event of rain\, the movie night w
 ill be canceled in advance and all tickets will be refunded.
LOCATION:Frank  Family Vineyards
URL:https://www.exploretock.com/frankfamilyvineyards/event/605549 
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
