BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sonoma Valley Pride Weekend Festival
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260613T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260613T220000
UID:2605186xBgisYDZUCDKTV4RIG8sA
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma Valley Pride Weekend\n\nSonoma Valley Pride returns for
  a full weekend of queer joy\, live entertainment\, community\, and Pride 
 in the heart of Sonoma Valley.\n\nThis year’s celebration expands into a
  three-day Pride weekend\, bringing together music\, drag\, dancing\, loca
 l artists\, food\, wine\, community organizations\, and LGBTQIA\\+ visibil
 ity across Sonoma. Sonoma Valley Pride is focused on building queer spaces
 \, creating joyful gathering places\, and bringing more LGBTQIA\\+ enterta
 inment and community-centered programming to the region.\n\nThe weekend ki
 cks off Friday\, June 12\, with We Rise With Pride\, Sonoma Valley Pride
 ’s first annual Concert and Drag Show at the historic Sebastiani Theatre
 . The evening features headliner J. Graves\, a queer\, non-binary-led band
  from Portland known for their guitar-driven sound\, bold vocals\, and hig
 h-energy live performances. Blending dance-punk\, post-punk\, and garage r
 ock influences\, J. Graves brings a sound that will appeal to fans of Yeah
  Yeah Yeahs and The Kills — rhythmic\, electric\, and built for the stag
 e. The night also features drag from Bay Area legends Kochina Rude\, Sonom
 a County native\, host\, and performer\, and Tila Pia\, an infamous stunt 
 queen who has turned looks from Hawaii to New York.\n\nOn Saturday\, June 
 13\, the celebration continues with a Pride Dance Party at The General’s
  Daughter\, inviting the community to keep the weekend moving with music\,
  dancing\, and celebration.\n\nOn Sunday\, June 14\, Sonoma Valley Pride g
 athers on the historic Sonoma Plaza for a free community Pride Festival fe
 aturing live performances\, speakers\, queer art\, local vendors\, food\, 
 wine\, and community connection. With a bigger stage\, more room to gather
 \, and even more ways to celebrate\, the Plaza Festival is designed for fr
 iends\, families\, chosen families\, locals\, visitors\, and allies to com
 e together in the spirit of Pride.\n\nFrom the theatre to the dance floor 
 to the Plaza lawn\, Sonoma Valley Pride weekend is a celebration of queer 
 artistry\, visibility\, belonging\, and joy in Sonoma Valley. Come ready t
 o dance\, show up\, and be part of what comes next.
LOCATION:Sonoma Plaza
URL:https://www.sonomavalleypride.com/?utm_source=press-democrat&utm_mediu
 m=social&utm_campaign=pride-weekend---2026-svp-pride-festival-&utm_content
 =press-dem---weekend-event-listing
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
