BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:2026 Solano County Fair
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260613T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260613T200000
UID:260330xJcljxqdVE6ZPWRkYXlPTw
DESCRIPTION:77th Annual Solano County Fair\n\nJoin us June 11&ndash\;14\, 
 2026 at the Solano County Fairgrounds in Vallejo for the 77th Annual Solan
 o County Fair. This year's theme\, &ldquo\;Stars\, Stripes\, and Carnival 
 Lights\,&rdquo\; celebrates America's 250th anniversary with four days of 
 carnival rides\, live entertainment\, fair food\, agricultural exhibits\, 
 livestock shows\, and interactive experiences for all ages.\n\nIn addition
  to general fair admission\, don't miss the exciting Arena Concert Series 
 featuring nightly live performances\, including Thursday's Julia Neville c
 oncert\, Friday's concert as well as the high-energy Saturday Demolition D
 erby &mdash\; both held in the Fairgrounds arena.\n\nA long-standing commu
 nity tradition\, the Solano County Fair brings together families\, friends
 \, and neighbors for a festive summer experience that showcases the region
 's rich heritage and spirit.\n\nTicket Information\n\nTickets are valid fo
 r the specific event date selected \\(Arena Concert or Demolition Derby\\)
 .\n\nEvery person entering will need a ticket.  Zero dollar tickets availa
 ble for Children under 6 available. Ages verified at the gates. \n\nPresal
 e ends at Midnight on June 10\, 2026.\n\nNo re-entry after 10:00 p.m. \\(S
 unday: no entry or re-entry after 9:00 p.m.\\).\n\nMerchandise ordered onl
 ine may be picked up at the Fair merchandise booth during event hours.\n\n
 Fair Hours\n\nThursday: 4:00 p.m. &ndash\; 10:00 p.m.\n\nFriday: 12:00 p.m
 . &ndash\; 10:00 p.m.\n\nSaturday: 12:00 p.m. &ndash\; 10:00 p.m.\n\nSunda
 y: 12:00 p.m. &ndash\; 10:00 p.m. \\(No entry or re-entry after 9:00 p.m.\
 \)\n\nParking Information\n\nParking is not included and must be purchased
  separately.\n\nADA parking is limited and available on a first-come\, fir
 st-served basis.
LOCATION:Solano County Fairgrounds
URL:https://tickets.eventhub.net/e/2026-solano-county-fair?aff=cityspark
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Broadway Under the Stars - Ain’t Too Proud: The Life and Times o
 f the Temp.
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260613T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260613T220000
UID:260330emNpAZlgEEyAphE7Wa6dLg
DESCRIPTION:*Ain’t Too Proud* is the Tony-winning\, electrifying musica
 l that follows The Temptations’ extraordinary journey from the streets o
 f Detroit to the Rock & Roll Hall of Fame. Featuring their signature dance
  moves and unforgettable harmonies\, this musical takes audiences behind t
 he music: how the group formed\, the unprecedented chart-topping success t
 hey achieved (42 Top Ten hits\, 14 #1 singles)\, and the personal and poli
 tical tensions that threatened their unity during a turbulent era in Ameri
 ca.\n\nThis thrilling story of brotherhood\, family loyalty and betrayal i
 s set to the beat of the group’s treasured hits\, including “My Girl\,
 ” “Just My Imagination\,” “Get Ready\,” “Papa Was a Rolling St
 one” and so many more\, with a book by award-winning playwright Dominiqu
 e Morisseau (*Skeleton Crew\, Paradise Blue*) adapted from Williams’s 19
 88 memoir. The New York Times praised the show as\, “Pretty close to pe
 rfect”\, with The Washington Post proclaiming it was “Dazzling and Ele
 ctrifying.”\n\n*Ain’t Too Proud* is presented through special arrange
 ment with Music Theatre International (MTI). All authorized performance ma
 terials are also supplied by MTI. www.mtishows.com\n\n***Music Theatre In
 ternational gives Ain’t Too Proud: The Life and Times of the Temptations
  a PG13 rating. This production is a gritty\, authentic look at the histo
 ry of The Temptations. Parental discretion is advised.***
LOCATION:Sonoma Field of Dreams
URL:https://transcendencetheatre.org/whats-on/aint-too-proud/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
