 all from Elbow’s Guy Garvey that saw her move to the UK. Her 2019 album 
 “Stonechild”\,  produced by John Parish \\(PJ Harvey\, Aldous Harding\
 , This is the Kit\\)\, received huge acclaim from fans and critics alike\,
  and it’s easy to see why: her beautiful songs\, rooted in the folk trad
 ition are intricately detailed\, acoustic-led pieces that teem with ideas.
