 Museum invites guests to meet the Ignatz-nominated interdisciplinary artis
 t and educator known for work that blends humor\, emotion\, and thoughtful
  storytelling. Visitors can watch Mara Ramirez discuss and demonstrate cre
 ative processes across comics\, zines\, animation\, and other cartoon form
 ats. Her work explores themes ranging from gender and identity to heartfel
 t and humorous character studies\, offering a unique perspective through v
