 ance from a local band or performer. Not to be confused with Tuesdays in t
 he Plaza\, this is a great opportunity to bring a picnic\, sit back\, rela
 x and enjoy the melodies.\n\nAbout the music: Laura Weinbach and Anton Pat
 zner of Foxtails Brigade reimagine their indie art-pop sound as an intimat
 e French café–style jazz duo\, blending French chanson\, Golden Era sta
 ndards\, and romantic originals. Having toured internationally and shared 
