BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Flora & Fauna - 6
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260614T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260614T160000
UID:260515S3seAmJZK0i_epP5VTdkXA
DESCRIPTION:In this 6 week course\, participants will learn a unique appro
 ach to watercolor\, intended to alleviate the frustration that many experi
 ence when learning this beautiful yet challenging medium. Instruction will
  focus on strengthening one's observational skills\, which are foundationa
 l to any painting practice. This approach to watercolor teaches the artist
  to see value and color while building your composition in luminous layers
 . Our subjects will be flora and fauna - a sampling of plants and animals 
 - fruits\, florals\, foliage\, and four legged friends. These subjects are
  great for beginners and experienced watercolor painters alike\; their org
 anic shapes make them forgiving drawing subjects\, but their beauty can be
  a muse for life. Over the course of the class we will progress through 3 
 compositions\, graduating from simpler to more complex forms. This class w
 ill work from life and from photos\, practicing basic drawing skills in ad
 dition to watercolor technique. With six class sessions\, participants wil
 l have the opportunity to develop their skills and build muscle memory wit
 h a medium that often feels like it has a mind of its own. All skill level
 s welcome. All materials provided.
LOCATION:D
URL:https://creativesonoma.org/event/flora-fauna-6-week-watercolor-course-
 with-hannah-day/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
