DESCRIPTION:Michael (Mike) Roa will present information about his new book
  (*An Introductory Field Guide to the Coast Redwoods)* and his ongoing con
 tributions to the North Bay Science Discovery Day.\n\nMike is a retired sc
 hool teacher. Since retiring\, he been involved in science and environment
 al education in a variety of ways\, including helping to organize the Nort
 h Bay Science Discovery Day\, volunteering with the Stewards of the Coast 
 and Redwoods and publishing a monthly science and environmental education 
 e-newsletter called The Grapevine.\n\nWhile a classroom teacher\, Mike and
  his students earned numerous science and environmental education awards. 
 He is the author of several science education magazine articles and books\
 , including the Environmental Science Activities Kit\, The Conifer Connect
 ion\, Redwood Ed\, A Guide to the Side of the Sea\, The Coast Redwood – 
 Sequoia sempervirens – A Primer\, and An Introductory Field Guide to the
  Coast Redwoods.
