DESCRIPTION:Don't miss the Eric Long Band tonight at Luther Locals Live\, 
 our free outdoor concert series! From the heart of West County\, the Eric 
 Long Band plays good-time\, feel-good\, fun-lovin’ music that harkens ba
 ck to the original Americana and Alt-Country acts of the 1960s and ‘70s.
  In 2025 the band released their full-length LP\, Honky Tonk Wisdom\, and 
 performed at San Francisco’s Hardly Strictly Bluegrass Festival. Situate
 d in a developing Sonoma County Sound\, the Eric Long Band delivers a howl
 ing good time that captures the unpolished joy of country played loud and 
 loose. Doors open at 4:30 for members\, 5:00 for the public. Music starts 
 at 5:30. For the summer lineup\, go to lutherburbankcenter.org/lutherlocal
