 n and Recent Learning Technologies \\(ICTERLT 2026\\) aims to advance inno
 vation and collaboration at the intersection of teaching\, educational sci
 ence\, and emerging learning technologies to shape the future of global ed
 ucation.\n\nWith a focus on transforming learning through technology and c
