 cution\, guiding participants to approach their work as if preparing it fo
 r submission to a publisher or for self-publishing.\n\nThis class is locat
 ed in the Main Gallery.\n\nAbout the Teacher: \n\nGus D'Angelo is the auth
 or/illustrator of the best-selling children's book National Parks A to Z \
 \(Mountaineers Books\\) and the brand new board book National Parks ABC!  
