UID:260604OPr6nL1NFkKNrMk6gw9Lbg
DESCRIPTION:**Long-Time Residents Tell Tales from 1976**\n\nJoanne Taeuffe
 r with Guest Speakers\n\nHear about our town 50 years ago from a few peopl
 e who remember it well. Joanne will interview long-time residents who shar
 e their memories of the economic and business environment\, the changes in
  the wine industry\, the foundation of the Healdsburg Museum and Historica
 l Society\, the high school band and more. And then we’ll ask audience m
 embers to share their stories.
