DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T113000
UID:260523_MvQdEHebEyNrY4tsbFffA
DESCRIPTION:Long-Time Residents Tell Tales from 1976\n\nHear about our tow
 n 50 years ago from a few people who remember it well. Joanne Taeuffer wil
 l interview long-time residents who share their memories of the economic a
 nd business environment\, the changes in the wine industry\, the foundatio
 n of the Healdsburg Museum and Historical Society\, the high school band a
 nd more. And then we’ll ask audience members to tell their stories from 
 1976.
