 Blake\, Velvet Shadows\, and DJ gamayabreak.\n\n**E. Live and Chesta Blake
 ** are a retro-styled dance duo playing original music from their vinyl 
 releases on Star Creature Records\, along with creative new takes on 80's 
 classics. \n\n**Velvet Shadows** are long-time friends that formed to ma
 ke fun\, funky versions of their soul favorites. Chelsea handles vocals an
 d bass and Eli plays guitar\, drums\, and produces. \n\n**DJ gamayabreak*
 * is a Santa Rosa based DJ who plays an eclectic mix of psych\, afrobeat\
 , brazillian\, jazz\, funk\, and disco exclusively on vinyl. He has perfor
 med locally at Bloodroot Winery\, Shady Oak Brewing\, and is a regular in 
 the rotation of djs at Glitter and Goth\, a monthly dance club in Santa Ro
 sa.
