DESCRIPTION:On Saturday\, June 20\, El Dorado is hosting a Pajama Party i
 n celebration of influential women in the community\, all in support of S
 onoma Valley Mentoring Alliance\, a local organization that helps youth in
  need of social and emotional support. The evening will begin with a champ
 agne welcome before settling into the cozy\, fireplace lounge with caviar 
