BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Broadway Under the Stars - Ain’t Too Proud: The Life and Times o
 f the Temp.
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260621T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260621T220000
UID:260330eZVXvm0HmkOsjmD7yhftKw
DESCRIPTION:*Ain’t Too Proud* is the Tony-winning\, electrifying musica
 l that follows The Temptations’ extraordinary journey from the streets o
 f Detroit to the Rock & Roll Hall of Fame. Featuring their signature dance
  moves and unforgettable harmonies\, this musical takes audiences behind t
 he music: how the group formed\, the unprecedented chart-topping success t
 hey achieved (42 Top Ten hits\, 14 #1 singles)\, and the personal and poli
 tical tensions that threatened their unity during a turbulent era in Ameri
 ca.\n\nThis thrilling story of brotherhood\, family loyalty and betrayal i
 s set to the beat of the group’s treasured hits\, including “My Girl\,
 ” “Just My Imagination\,” “Get Ready\,” “Papa Was a Rolling St
 one” and so many more\, with a book by award-winning playwright Dominiqu
 e Morisseau (*Skeleton Crew\, Paradise Blue*) adapted from Williams’s 19
 88 memoir. The New York Times praised the show as\, “Pretty close to pe
 rfect”\, with The Washington Post proclaiming it was “Dazzling and Ele
 ctrifying.”\n\n*Ain’t Too Proud* is presented through special arrange
 ment with Music Theatre International (MTI). All authorized performance ma
 terials are also supplied by MTI. www.mtishows.com\n\n***Music Theatre In
 ternational gives Ain’t Too Proud: The Life and Times of the Temptations
  a PG13 rating. This production is a gritty\, authentic look at the histo
 ry of The Temptations. Parental discretion is advised.***
LOCATION:Sonoma Field of Dreams
URL:https://transcendencetheatre.org/whats-on/aint-too-proud/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
