 h a guided two-mile hike through scenic trails above the estate\, offering
  sweeping views and engaging points of interest along the way. After the h
 ike\, guests are invited to relax with a seasonal picnic lunch served on t
 he Sunset Terrace and Eucalyptus Grove\, paired with a selection of estate
  wines. This moderate uphill hike is designed for an active yet enjoyable 
