DESCRIPTION:Don't miss Erica Ambrin & The Eclectic Soul Project \\(ESP\\)t
 onight at Luther Locals Live\, our free outdoor concert series! ESP is an 
 ever-evolving Soul band with a dash of Hip-Hop from Northern California. F
 ormed in 2015 while recording Ambrin’s debut EP Suga\, the band is a col
 lective of musicians from all walks of life – a jam band homage to music
 . ESP’s unique dynamics fuse soulful lead vocals and deeply personal lyr
 ics with high energy bravado. The band has opened for iconic musicians suc
 h as KRS-One\, Nappy Roots\, The Wailers\, Martin Luther\, and Anuhea. Aft
 er gaining popularity as a contestant on American Idol\, Ambrin moved to M
 aui to record her first hip-hop project Lucid Dreamer.  Doors open at 4:30
