BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:World Dance
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260624T171500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260624T181500
UID:2605175_7xFKNwuEmkuSgI15BTFg
DESCRIPTION:Travel the World—No Passport Required!\n\nGrab your global o
 ne-way ticket to fitness. We’re traveling across continents through rhyt
 hm and movement\, blending high-energy world dances with a full-body worko
 ut. Whether you’re a seasoned pro or have two left feet\, come sweat\, s
 mile\, and discover your new favorite beat.\n\nWho: All adult ages and sk
 ill levels.\n\nWhen: Wednesdays @ 5:15 PM\n\nThe Vibe: Pure fun\, global
  rhythms\, and a community that moves together.\n\nAbout Zeena\n\nZeena Qu
 inn’s World Dance classes are based on learning coordination\, motivatin
 g the brain\, dance techniques\, and therefore\, mind-body transformation.
  By creating a supportive system\, participants discover themselves in the
 ir own way via dance.\n\nParticipants will work upper and lower body\, car
 dio and mostly rhythms & coordination. One will understand and learn to id
 entify the different rhythms while having fun! Zeena has a lifetime of exp
 erience in dance\, professional performance\, choreography\, teaching\, as
  well as\, in fitness and resistance training.\n\nZeena has toured the Bay
  Area presenting a variety of American swing\, Charlston\, hip hop\, disco
 \, line dances\, and international dance styles such as Bollywood\, Afro-B
 razilian/Samba\, Flamenco\, and European and Eastern Folk. These authentic
  dance techniques demonstrate how our body is an instrument. Because of he
 r extensive range of dance training\, she brings the authenticity of techn
 ique into her vibrant teaching style.\n\nCome take a trip around theworld!
  Comfortable clothes and worn shoes that tie. No Hoka or hiking shoes plea
 se.
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/world-dance/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
