DESCRIPTION:Join Forestville Librarians on the last Wednesday of every mon
 th to discuss fiction and non-fiction books! Pick up a copy of this month'
 s selection at the Reference Desk while supplies last. Book Club titles an
 d dates are subject to change. sonomalibrary.org/bookclubs 2026 Schedule J
 anuary 28 - The Midnight Library by Matt Haig February 25 - The Savage Kin
 d by John Copenhaver March 25 - It Rhymes with Takei by George Takei April
  29 - The Thirty Names of Night by Zeyn Joukhadar May 27 - The Antique Hun
 ter's Guide to Murder by C.L. Miller June 24 - The Stonewall Reader Edited
  by the NY Public Library July 29 - River Sing Me Home by Eleanor Shearer 
 August 26 - How to Solve your own Murder by Kristen Perrin September 30 - 
 The Wide Wide Sea by Hampton Sides October 28 - Love After the End by Josh
 ua Whitehead November 25 - The Bad Muslim Discount by Syed M. Masood
LOCATION:Forestville Community Library
